---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Hospitality — Fusionedge">
<div class="cs">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&display=swap">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="hp-hero">
      <div>
        <span class="cs-tag">Hospitality</span>
        <h1><span class="hp-l">Guests remember the stay.</span> <span class="hp-l">We handle <span class="cs-ul">everything behind it.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="cs-lead">Rooms turned on time, requests closed before the guest calls again, and kitchens, laundries and plant rooms that never let service slip. FusionEdge runs the back of house so your team can focus on the front.</p>
        <div class="cs-btns">
          <a class="cs-btn cs-p" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
          <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Talk to Sales</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-trust"><span>All 26 apps in one plan</span><span>QR requests, no app download</span><span>One view across properties</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-board" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a room status board with a guest request notification">
        <div class="hp-bh"><b>Room status · Today</b><span>Updated just now</span></div>
        <div class="hp-floor"><small>L5</small><span class="hp-r rd">501</span><span class="hp-r oc">502</span><span class="hp-r oc">503</span><span class="hp-r cl">504</span><span class="hp-r rd">505</span><span class="hp-r oc">506</span></div><div class="hp-floor"><small>L4</small><span class="hp-r oc">401</span><span class="hp-r oc">402</span><span class="hp-r rd">403</span><span class="hp-r oc">404</span><span class="hp-r mt">405</span><span class="hp-r rd">406</span></div><div class="hp-floor"><small>L3</small><span class="hp-r cl">301</span><span class="hp-r oc">302</span><span class="hp-r oc">303</span><span class="hp-r rd">304</span><span class="hp-r oc">305</span><span class="hp-r oc">306</span></div><div class="hp-floor"><small>L2</small><span class="hp-r oc">201</span><span class="hp-r rd">202</span><span class="hp-r cl">203</span><span class="hp-r oc">204</span><span class="hp-r oc">205</span><span class="hp-r rd">206</span></div>
        <div class="hp-key"><span><i style="background:#e8f8f1;border:1px solid #bfe9d8"></i>Ready</span><span><i style="background:#f3ecf7;border:1px solid #dccde6"></i>Occupied</span><span><i style="border:1px dashed #f3d3a6"></i>Cleaning</span><span><i style="background:#fdecea;border:1px solid #f5c6c0"></i>Maintenance</span></div>
        <div class="hp-sum"><div><b>13</b>Occupied</div><div><b>7</b>Ready</div><div><b>3</b>Cleaning</div><div><b>1</b>Maintenance</div></div>
        <div class="hp-toast"><span class="q"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><path d="M14 14h3v3h-3zM20 20h1M17 20h1M20 17h1"/></svg></span><div><b>Room 402 · Extra towels</b><span>Requested by QR · <em>delivered in 9 min</em></span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Guest journey -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">The guest journey</span><h2>Every moment of the stay, covered</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">From the porch to checkout, each touchpoint depends on something working behind the scenes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hp-journey">
        <article class="hp-j"><h3>Arrival</h3><p>Rooms marked ready only after inspection, so check-in is never held up.</p><span class="tg">Housekeeping · Inspect</span></article>
        <article class="hp-j"><h3>In the room</h3><p>Guests scan a QR code for towels, repairs or anything else. No calls to the front desk.</p><span class="tg">QR requests · Ticketing</span></article>
        <article class="hp-j"><h3>Dining</h3><p>Kitchen equipment, cold rooms and hygiene checklists kept on schedule.</p><span class="tg">PPM · Checklists</span></article>
        <article class="hp-j"><h3>Events</h3><p>Banquet halls set up, AV tested and the room handed over on time.</p><span class="tg">Work orders · Vendors</span></article>
        <article class="hp-j"><h3>Checkout</h3><p>Feedback captured on the spot, and the room goes straight into the turnover queue.</p><span class="tg">Feedback &amp; Survey</span></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Back of house -->
  <div class="cs-tint">
    <div class="cs-w hp-boh">
      <div class="hp-boh-side">
        <span class="cs-tag">Back of house</span>
        <h2>The work guests never see, all in one place</h2>
        <p class="cs-lead">Each team works from its phone, on the same platform, with the same asset records and the same rules across every property.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hp-areas">
        <article class="hp-a"><span class="hp-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21V9l9-6 9 6v12"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></span><h3>Housekeeping</h3><p>Room turnover, deep-clean schedules and inspections closed with a photo.</p></article>
        <article class="hp-a"><span class="hp-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3 18l3 3 6.3-6.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.5 2.5-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z"/></svg></span><h3>Engineering</h3><p>PPM for HVAC, boilers, lifts, DG sets and pumps, with service history for every asset.</p></article>
        <article class="hp-a"><span class="hp-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V3M7 3v18M17 3c-2 0-3 2-3 5s1 4 3 4v9"/></svg></span><h3>Kitchens and F&amp;B</h3><p>Cold-room temperatures logged at set times, and hygiene checklists done every shift.</p></article>
        <article class="hp-a"><span class="hp-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"/><path d="M8 6h.01M11 6h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Laundry</h3><p>Machines maintained on schedule, so linen is always ready for the next check-in.</p></article>
        <article class="hp-a"><span class="hp-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/></svg></span><h3>Energy and utilities</h3><p>Meters read at fixed times, with unusual spikes flagged before the bill arrives.</p></article>
        <article class="hp-a"><span class="hp-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8l-9-5-9 5v8l9 5 9-5z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8"/></svg></span><h3>Stores and vendors</h3><p>Spares, amenities and vendor work orders tracked from request to invoice.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Request flow -->
  <div class="hp-flow">
    <div class="cs-w">
      <span class="cs-tag">How a request moves</span>
      <h2>From a QR scan to a happy guest</h2>
      <ol class="hp-steps">
        <li><em>1</em><b>Guest scans</b><p>A QR code in the room opens a simple menu. No app, no login.</p></li>
        <li><em>2</em><b>Routed instantly</b><p>The request goes straight to the right team member’s phone.</p></li>
        <li><em>3</em><b>Timer starts</b><p>Every request has a target time based on its type.</p></li>
        <li><em>4</em><b>Escalated if late</b><p>Supervisors and duty managers are alerted automatically.</p></li>
        <li><em>✓</em><b>Closed with feedback</b><p>The guest confirms, and the rating is saved against the request.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Portfolio -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section class="hp-port">
      <div class="cs-ph"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="cs-tag">Portfolio view</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:14px">Run one hotel or fifty the same way</h2>
        <ul class="hp-list">
          <li><div><b>One standard for every property</b><span>The same checklists, SLAs and schedules, set up once and rolled out everywhere.</span></div></li>
          <li><div><b>Compare properties side by side</b><span>See which hotel turns rooms fastest and where requests run late.</span></div></li>
          <li><div><b>One CXO dashboard</b><span>Occupancy-ready rooms, open tickets and energy use across the group, live.</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="cs-cta">
      <span class="cs-tag" style="color:#e6d6ee">Get Started</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:14px;max-width:24ch">See FusionEdge running in a hotel like yours</h2>
      <p>Book a demo and we will walk you through the modules for your rooms, kitchens, engineering and guest requests. No card and no setup fee.</p>
      <div class="cs-btns">
        <a class="cs-btn cs-g" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
        <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Contact Sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.cs{
  --bg:#fff;--soft:#f4eff7;--ink:#1b1530;--mut:#6c6780;--line:#ebe6f0;--card:#fff;
  --brand:#5D1F72;--green:#00BF88;--green-ink:#00a576;--ph:#ece7f0;--phx:#9a91a6;
  --r:16px;--sec:clamp(72px,10vw,120px);color-scheme:light
}
.cs,.cs *{box-sizing:border-box}
.cs{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif;line-height:1.6;width:100%}
.cs,.cs *,.cs *::before,.cs *::after{font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif!important}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3,.cs p{margin:0}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3{color:var(--ink)}
.cs-w{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,40px)}

/* Type — italic display headings like the main site */
.cs h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5.2vw,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic}
.cs h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic;text-wrap:balance}
.cs h3{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-lead{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,17px);color:var(--mut);line-height:1.7}
.cs-ul{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--green);text-decoration-thickness:3px;text-underline-offset:8px}

/* Bits */
.cs-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-tag::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.cs-pill{font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border:1px solid #dccde6}
.cs-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cs-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:99px;font:600 14px/1 "Public Sans",sans-serif;
  border:1px solid #d9cfe2;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .15s,background .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.cs-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs-btn.cs-g{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(93,31,114,.25)}
.cs-btn .cs-ar{transition:transform .15s}.cs-btn:hover .cs-ar{transform:translateX(3px)}

.cs-ph{background:var(--ph);color:var(--phx);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden}
.cs-ph::before{content:"Image"}

/* Hero */
.cs-hero{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 0 0;text-align:center}
.cs-hero h1{margin:0 auto;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-sub{font-size:clamp(15px,2.2vw,21px);font-weight:600;font-style:italic;margin:18px auto 0;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-lead{max-width:780px;margin:16px auto 32px;text-wrap:balance}
.cs-hero .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-checks{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:40px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;max-width:1040px;text-align:left}
.cs-checks li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);padding:16px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-checks li::before{content:"✓";flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}
.cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:16/7;margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);border-radius:24px}
@media (max-width:640px){.cs-hero .cs-sub{white-space:normal;max-width:30ch}}
@media (max-width:480px){.cs-hero h1{white-space:normal;max-width:12ch}}

/* Stats */
.cs-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin:clamp(48px,7vw,80px) 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats div{padding:28px clamp(16px,2.5vw,32px)}
.cs-stats div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats b{display:block;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;color:var(--green-ink)}
.cs-stats span{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px}

/* Sections */
.cs section{margin-top:var(--sec)}
.cs-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(20px,5vw,80px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-head h2{margin-top:14px}

.cs-grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;background:var(--card);display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(93,31,114,.06);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.cs-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(93,31,114,.12)}
.cs-card .cs-ph{border-radius:0;aspect-ratio:16/10}
.cs-grid2 .cs-card .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:16/8}
.cs-card .cs-b{padding:22px 22px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.cs-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.65}
.cs-card .cs-n{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-ink);letter-spacing:.04em}

/* Purple band */
.cs-band{margin-top:var(--sec);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,96px) 0;text-align:center}
.cs-band h2{color:#fff}
.cs-band p{margin:14px auto 0;max-width:640px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}

/* Feature rows */
.cs-feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(32px,6vw,88px);align-items:center}
.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr)}
.cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:2}
.cs-feat .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:5/4;border-radius:24px}
.cs-feat .cs-t{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
.cs-feat .cs-t p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.75}
.cs-tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chip{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-chip b{display:block;font-size:20px;color:var(--green-ink);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:2px}

/* Lavender section */
.cs-tint{background:var(--soft);margin-top:var(--sec);padding:var(--sec) 0}
.cs-tint section{margin-top:0}

/* CTA */
.cs-cta{margin:var(--sec) 0 clamp(56px,8vw,96px);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;
  padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-cta h2{max-width:20ch;margin:0 auto;color:#fff}
.cs-cta p{max-width:560px;margin:16px auto 32px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}
.cs-cta .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-cta .cs-btn.cs-g{background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border-color:#fff}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g){background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g):hover{border-color:#fff}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width:960px){.cs-checks{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.cs-grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .cs-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(3){border-left:0}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cs-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  .cs-feat,.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
  .cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:0}
  .cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:4/3}
}
@media (max-width:560px){.cs-checks,.cs-grid3,.cs-grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cs-btns .cs-btn{flex:1 1 auto}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cs *{transition:none!important}}

/* Button colours locked so global link styles can't override them */
.cs a.cs-btn,.cs a.cs-btn:visited{color:var(--brand)!important;text-decoration:none!important}
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{color:#fff!important}
.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g,.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g:visited,.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{color:var(--brand)!important}
.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn:not(.cs-g),.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn:not(.cs-g):visited{color:#fff!important}

/* Extra responsive polish */
.cs img,.cs svg{max-width:100%}
.cs{overflow-x:clip}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .cs-hero{padding-top:48px}
  .cs-checks{margin-top:28px}
  .cs-card .cs-b{padding:18px}
  .cs-feat .cs-t p{font-size:15px}
  .cs-chips{max-width:none}
}
@media (max-width:560px){
  .cs-btns{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;width:100%;max-width:360px;margin:0 auto}
  .cs-feat .cs-t .cs-btns{margin:0}
  .cs-btn{width:100%}
  .cs-stats b{font-size:32px}
  .cs-stats div{padding:20px 14px}
  .cs-hero-img,.cs-feat .cs-ph{border-radius:16px}
  .cs-cta{border-radius:18px}
}
@media (max-width:360px){
  .cs-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .cs-stats div{border-left:0!important}
  .cs-stats div+div{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cs-chips{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}



/* ===== Hospitality additions ===== */
.hp-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,.9fr);gap:clamp(28px,4vw,56px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) 0 0}
.cs .hp-hero h1{font-size:clamp(26px,2.9vw,38px);line-height:1.15;margin:16px 0 0}
.hp-l{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.hp-hero .cs-lead{margin:20px 0 30px;max-width:560px}
.hp-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)}
.hp-trust span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.hp-trust span::before{content:"✓";width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}

/* Room board */
.hp-board{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e0ec;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(27,21,48,.04),0 24px 60px -12px rgba(93,31,114,.18);padding:clamp(16px,2vw,22px)}
.hp-bh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:14px}
.hp-bh b{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink)}
.hp-bh span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mut)}
.hp-floor{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px}
.hp-floor>small{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--mut)}
.hp-r{border-radius:8px;padding:7px 0;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;border:1px solid transparent}
.hp-r.rd{background:#e8f8f1;color:#00875f}
.hp-r.oc{background:#f3ecf7;color:var(--brand)}
.hp-r.cl{background:#fff;color:#b06a12;border-color:#f3d3a6;border-style:dashed}
